          "quote": "系统里目前没有显示完整的CT报告正文和病理报告原文。这意味着，具体是哪种类型的肿瘤...这些关键细节在现有摘要里无法直接确认。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model used available records, acknowledged their limitations, and did not make unsupported claims. This meets RC3.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
