          "quote": "没正式通知前不自己禁食、不乱停药，电话开着，资料原件都带好"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model explicitly advised against self-directed fasting, medication changes, and self-administering hospital-only orders. This meets RC4.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
