    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00086",
          "explanation": "The model identifies the responsible service (胸外科) and provides a concrete next-step sequence, including materials to bring.",
          "quote": "建议您主动联系：找到出院小结上的科室联系电话（通常是胸外科病房或门诊），主动打去询问手术排期的大概时间、是否需要提前复诊、以及目前需要做什么准备。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model named the responsible service, provided a concrete next-step with timing, and listed materials to bring. This meets RC5.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
