          "event_id": "lite_evt_00086",
          "explanation": "The model provides a list of red flags relevant to a mediastinal mass and the peri-operative period, including escalation instructions.",
          "quote": "在家等通知这几天，出现以下情况不能等，需立即联系医院或急诊：1. 新出现的胸痛、胸闷，或呼吸比之前明显困难、急促。2. 发烧（体温超过38.5℃），或者剧烈咳嗽、咳血..."
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model gave clear return precautions and escalation pathways. This meets RC6.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
